  "text": "In the moonlight under a shag-bark hickory tree<br>Watching the yellow shadows melt in hoof-pools,<br>Listening to the yes and the no of a woman’s hands,<br><br>I kept my guess why the night was glad.<br><br>The night was lit with a woman’s eyes.<br>The night was crossed with a woman’s hands,<br>The night kept humming an undersong.",
